#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:11 f291e14666a349d7a793b078df39df3d
msgid ""
"A threaded C core (`libfreeswitch`) plus loadable DSOs implement SIP/WebRTC "
"switching, RTP, dialplan, and ESL. System libraries (Sofia-SIP, SpanDSP, "
"OpenSSL, libks) and a few vendored trees (`libs/apr`, `libs/srtp`, "
"`libs/libvpx`, …) provide portability, crypto, and codecs."
msgstr ""
"带线程的 C 核心（`libfreeswitch`）加上可加载 DSO，实现 SIP/WebRTC 交换、RTP、拨号计划和 "
"ESL。系统库（Sofia-"
"SIP、SpanDSP、OpenSSL、libks）以及若干内嵌树（`libs/apr`、`libs/srtp`、`libs/libvpx`、…）提供可移植性、加密和编解码器。"

