#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:80 b38c1ac036fc4fecab7f1a713a1251f8
msgid "Runtime Interaction Model"
msgstr "运行时交互模型"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:82 752578a701cb43c787896bd43977c270
msgid ""
"**Signaling** (Sofia/Verto) accepts a call and asks the core for a "
"`switch_core_session_t`."
msgstr "**信令**（Sofia/Verto）接受呼叫并向核心请求 `switch_core_session_t`。"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:83 5ed8b678f7314674a0777a45cae0090a
msgid ""
"**Core** runs the channel state machine; **XML dialplan** "
"(`mod_dialplan_xml`) picks applications."
msgstr "**核心**运行通道状态机；**XML 拨号计划**（`mod_dialplan_xml`）选择应用。"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:84 ae5047ca06b84e0b999e4f15d2c546b7
msgid ""
"**Applications** (dptools, conference, …) bridge or play media; **codecs** "
"and **libSRTP/OpenSSL** handle RTP."
msgstr ""
"**应用**（dptools、conference、…）桥接或播放媒体；**编解码器**和 **libSRTP/OpenSSL** 处理 RTP。"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:85 2b9961d85d774430ba0c7e1e01d99283
msgid ""
"**Events** go to the in-process bus; **ESL** clients and CDR modules consume"
" them. **SQLite** holds core scoreboard unless `-nosql`."
msgstr "**事件**进入进程内总线；**ESL** 客户端和 CDR 模块消费它们。除非 `-nosql`，**SQLite** 保存核心记分板。"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:87 fbac4f912ac44ad6aac3d37bfde0970e
msgid ""
"Layers do **not** talk over HTTP internally. The process is the unit of "
"composition; DSOs register interface tables."
msgstr "各层内部**不**通过 HTTP 通信。进程是组合单元；DSO 注册接口表。"

